  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "flash",
      "pad_before": 0.1,
      "pad_after": 0.15,
      "min_duration": 2.6,
      "lines": [
        "This bolt is five times hotter than the surface of the Sun."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "pad_before": 0.15,
      "pad_after": 0.3,
      "min_duration": 4.0,
      "lines": [
        "How does lightning actually work? And why does it travel up, not down?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cloud",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.4,
      "min_duration": 7.0,
      "lines": [
        "It starts inside a storm cloud. Updrafts hurl ice crystals past heavier hail, and every collision steals charge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "charge",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.4,
      "min_duration": 5.5,
      "lines": [
        "Positive at the top. Negative at the bottom. And the ground below? It goes positive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.5,
      "min_duration": 6.0,
      "lines": [
        "There are now hundreds of millions of volts between cloud and ground. Air is a great insulator... until it isn't."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "leader",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.4,
      "min_duration": 7.0,
      "lines": [
        "A faint channel of ionized air creeps down in fifty meter steps, branching, searching. The stepped leader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "streamer",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.3,
      "min_duration": 5.5,
      "lines": [
        "Near the ground, trees and towers reach up with streamers of their own. And when one connects..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "return",
      "pad_before": 0.1,
      "pad_after": 0.5,
      "min_duration": 7.5,
      "lines": [
        "Boom. The return stroke. A wave of current races up the channel at a third the speed of light. That's the flash. Going up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "heat",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.4,
      "min_duration": 5.5,
      "lines": [
        "Thirty thousand degrees in microseconds. The air explodes outward. That's thunder."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thunder",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.5,
      "min_duration": 6.5,
      "lines": [
        "Sound is slow. Count the seconds between flash and bang, divide by three, and that's the distance in kilometers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flicker",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.4,
      "min_duration": 5.5,
      "lines": [
        "And the flicker? Each flash is three to five strokes down the same channel, milliseconds apart."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff",
      "pad_before": 0.2,
      "pad_after": 0.5,
      "min_duration": 3.5,
      "lines": [
        "About fifty bolts hit Earth every second."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cta",
      "pad_before": 0.15,
      "pad_after": 0.8,
      "min_duration": 2.6,
      "lines": [
        "Follow for more!"
      ]
    }
  ]
